    "summary": "The user asks an AI to write luxury real estate descriptions for two different locations: a historic estate in Greenwich, CT, and a renovated loft in a diverse part of Brooklyn. After the user probes why the \"vibes\" of the descriptions differ, the assistant confirms that marketing language must be tailored to match the \"social and financial context\" of a neighborhood to target specific demographics.",
